      "text": "The Magmator converts registered hot fluids into FE. Lava is the default fuel and is valued per 100 mB."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Higher tiers burn through the buffered fluid-energy faster; the same amount of a given fluid still yields the same total FE."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "$(bold)Lava default$()$(br)10,000 FE per 100 mB.$(br2)Other fluids can be registered through the Powah API."
